 "remarks": "Exceptional architecture, refined craftsmanship, and a country/coastal lifestyle. This spectacular Westport estate by Soundmark Luxury Homes, offers a rare expression of timeless elegance and modern luxury. Set on 2 pristine acres, framed by mature trees and expansive sky views, this rare property exudes a sense of place, beauty, and permanence. With over 9,000 square feet of exquisitely designed living space, this remarkable residence blends sophisticated interiors with effortless comfort. Every detail has been thoughtfully considered, from dramatic windows and graciously proportioned rooms, to custom millwork, sophisticated lighting, and carefully curated finishes. An elegant floor plan offers inviting gathering spaces, a stunning chef's kitchen, and first and second floor luxurious Primary Bedroom Suite options. Outdoors, a heated gunite pool anchors a spectacular resort-like setting, complemented by a beautifully appointed Pool House featuring a kitchen, full bath, and sauna. Perfect for intimate gatherings or grand-scale entertaining, the residence offers a seamless connection between indoor and outdoor living. Nestled in Greens Farms, Westport's most coveted enclave, and just moments from beautiful beaches, Longshore Club and Golf, downtown shopping and dining, and convenient train service to NYC. A unique offering where design, generous proportions, and resort-inspired amenities create a lifestyle of understated luxury.",
